          "text": "<p>In the logic circuit shown in the figure, $Y$ is given by<br><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></p><ol start=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\"><li>$Y=A B C D$<br>&nbsp;</li><li>$Y=(A+B)(C+D)$<br>&nbsp;</li><li>$Y=A+B+C+D$<br>&nbsp;</li><li>$Y=A B+C D$</li></ol>",
